  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lebanon LRC DM Capacity Building PPL 2021-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to conduct capacity building trainings and workshops for both LRC-DM&#x2019;s staff and volunteers in order to improve the efficacy and quality of DM interventions and field approaches. Furthermore, as part of DMS&#x2019;s new strategy, this project will contribute to implement the general strategy, by meeting the minimum training standards set for DM centers. The project will specifically assist in filling gaps existing in teams through equipping and training DM volunteers on various skills and technicalities thus, empowering them to lead field interventions both efficiently and effectively. Therefore, LRC administered trainings will ensure a unified approach to activity implementation on the field, across Lebanon.</narrative>
  </description>
